udent council vice president. Good grades and looks, also takes the surrounding atmosphere into account, he is very popular with the girls. Although he will take the surrounding circumstances into account, but somehow he managed to end up getting into an relationship with four girls, and is unable to reach a decision. Because of the girls, he is currently in the biggest crisis of his life. While the girls all wholeheartedly love him, he is just taking advantage of the situation to get laid and does not hold any special feelings towards them. He still does not know what true love is."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21761"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/9465288a065b967e576f40f7e6e3a8bce8ef35d617c1e8a685ea80637b3255a6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d78359affdb5a72479c2ff75d562d3eb08bb53faa3c21745b3164c717e06d7ff.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c21762","characterName":"百井 霧子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c21762"},"originalCharacterName":"百井 霧子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kamijou Gakuen second year student and the student council secretary. Highly infatuated with Aoi, she admire her greatly and refers to her as onee-sama. She is usually a good girl, but when a boy tries to get close to Aoi, she will become abusive towards them. Consider the protagonist as the bastard that keeps pestering Aoi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c21762"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5623a36149eb7c47c33e06ad81696b1